# Arathi Highlands with Swamp of Sorrows, Alterac Mountains and Hillsbrad,
# Alliance ~38 to ~39 (consensus visits 21-27). Flow: Swamp of Sorrows
# (Watcher Biggs, the Harborage, the Fallow Sanctuary) > Stormwind (class
# training, the Stern and Southshore errands) > Southshore (bind) > Refuge
# Pointe > Northfold Manor > Faldir's Cove > Go'Shek Farm and the Myzrael
# story > Witherbark Village > hearth to Southshore > Alterac Mountains
# (Strahnbrad, the Crushridge ogres, Dalaran) > Southshore > Ironforge
# (training) > Loch Modan, ready for the Badlands.
#
# Forever above level 30 cannot be checked in game until launch on 4
# November: the Forever additions here come from the data, not from play.
# Added (Forever):
# - My Little Friends (93176): the consensus takes and hands it in on its
#   Swamp of Sorrows visit at 42.7, but its three critters live in Arathi,
#   Desolace and Stranglethorn (data spawns). It is taken here from Amaryllis
#   Webb, beside Watcher Biggs; the Hay Weevil is caught at Northfold Manor,
#   the Flesh Picker by the Kodo Graveyard (06-badlands), the Arbor Tarantula
#   in northern Stranglethorn, and it is handed in on the Swamp stop of
#   40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale. The data has no objectives for it, so each
#   catch is a check-off the player ticks.
# - Left out: Friend of the Kirin Tor (92459): the Image of Archmage Modera
#   offers it only after Heart of Disruption (92458), the City of Dalaran
#   dungeon quest that An Alarming Request leads to (the quest chain
#   foreverchanges.pro shows from Wowhead's Forever database, checked
#   2026-10-17; its text, "the city is calming down ... take this mote",
#   follows the dungeon). The data has no prerequisite.
# - The Image of Archmage Modera stands just inside Silverpine Forest in the
#   data: the turn-in now uses the data's position instead of typed Alterac
#   coordinates.
# Deviations from the export:
# - The Lost Supplies (1423, a crate in the Swamp) and The Thandol Span part 2
#   (632) are never turned in on the route: left out.
# - Arathor Basic Care Package (8260) is an Arathi Basin reputation quest:
#   left out.
# - Baron's Demise, Crushridge Bounty, Preserving Knowledge, The Ensorcelled
#   Parchment and Hints of a New Plague? (661) are turned in at Southshore on
#   the way back from Alterac instead of on the route's later Southshore visit
#   (~42.7): their enders stand next to the other turn-ins, so it costs nothing.
# - Crystal in the Mountains (635) is optional: it starts from a rare's drop
#   in Stranglethorn. The Princess Trapped starts at the shards without it.
# - The Thandol Span (631) is accepted here from Rhag Garmason at Dun Modr,
#   just over the bridge, instead of on an earlier Wetlands visit.
# - Local order: the route's Stormwind stop gains class training.
# - Dropped: This Must Be The Place (79976): the Messenger Bag on Thoradin's
#   Wall offers it only after Eagle's Fist (79975) and the rest of the Cozy
#   Sleeping Bag chain, which no Alliance guide takes.
# - Restored, all on the way: Dark Council (537; Further Mysteries is now
#   handed in on the first Southshore stop so Maleb offers it before Alterac;
#   the Shadow Mages stand at the Ruins of Alterac, Nagaz by the parchment
#   chest), Stormpike's Deciphering (554, Dibbs > Prospector Stormpike on the
#   Ironforge fly-through) and Return to Milton (542, Dibbs > Milton Sheaf,
#   handed in by 40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale's Stormwind stop).
# - Not restored: The Curse of the Tides (611) needs Catelyn's Blade (610)
#   and Return to Corporal Kaleb (622) needs Favor for Krazek (627), both
#   turned in only in 40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale; Sunken Treasure (670) and
#   Death From Below (667) need Sunken Treasure (669), handed to Fleet Master
#   Seahorn in Booty Bay in that same later guide; Goblin Sponsorship (1182)
#   needs the Ratchet chain (1180, 1181), which no Alliance guide takes.
# - Southshore after the hearth, in walking order from the inn: Phin,
#   Redpath, Maleb, Bartolo, Dibbs, Darren.
# Class quests: Warlocks hand the Heartswood to Gakin and summon their
# Succubus (1738, 1739) at the Stormwind stop. Warlocks who took What Is
# Love? (65602, optional, Forever) hand Gakin the Wooden Figurine there too
# and bind the incubus (The Binding 65603, Small Soul Pouch) at the same
# circle (Forever data, not play; forever/class/warlock/incubus-alliance).
# Class training: Stormwind, around level 38 (Shamans by the Deeprun Tram in
# Ironforge), and Ironforge again at 39 on the way to Loch Modan (Druids:
# Ironforge has no druid trainer).
guide forever/alliance/30-40/05-arathi-highlands
title Arathi Highlands, Alterac Mountains & Swamp of Sorrows
faction Alliance
levels 37-40
zone Arathi Highlands
next forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Swamp of Sorrows

step Fly to Darkshire
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  fly "Darkshire"                     -- Gyll, Booty Bay

step Watcher Biggs
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip From Darkshire follow the road east through Deadwind Pass into the Swamp of Sorrows; Biggs guards the road junction just inside it. Amaryllis Webb stands a short way north of him.
  accept 1396                         -- Watcher Biggs
  accept 93176                        -- Amaryllis Webb: three critters to catch in Arathi, Desolace and Stranglethorn

step The western swamp
  tip Young crocolisks, Sorrow Spinners and Swamp Jaguars all roam the swamp around the road.
  kill 1084 quest 1396.1              -- Young Sawtooth Crocolisk
  kill 858 quest 1396.2               -- Sorrow Spinner
  kill 767 quest 1396.3               -- Swamp Jaguar

step Watcher Biggs
  turnin 1396
  accept 1421

step The Lost Caravan
  tip The wrecked caravan lies off the road near Biggs.
  collect 6170 quest 1421             -- Wizards' Reagents

step Watcher Biggs
  turnin 1421

step The Harborage
  tip Follow the road north to the draenei of the Harborage.
  accept 1389                         -- Magtoor

step Fallow Sanctuary
  tip East along the road to the Fallow Sanctuary. The Lost One mobs drop the crystals; Noboru walks the ruins and drops his cudgel.
  collect 6071 quest 1389             -- Draenethyst Crystal
  collect 6196 "Noboru's Cudgel"
  accept 1392

step Galen Goodward
  tip Galen is caged at the north end of the sanctuary. Free him and keep him alive on the walk out; his strongbox waits by the road afterwards.
  accept 1393
  complete 1393
  turnin 1393                         -- Galen's Strongbox

step The Harborage
  turnin 1392                         -- Magtoor
  turnin 1389

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stormwind

step Fly to Stormwind
  tip Back west through Deadwind Pass to Darkshire.
  zone Duskwood
  fly "Stormwind"                     -- Felicia Maline, Darkshire

step Stormwind
  zone Stormwind City
  accept 212                          -- Angus Stern, Stormwind Harbor road
  accept 1260
  accept 6141                         -- Brother Crowley, Cathedral of Light
  accept 538                          -- Milton Sheaf, the Royal Library in the keep
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid

step The Binding
  only Warlock
  tip Gakin the Darkbinder waits in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar, in the Mage Quarter. Use the Heartswood Core at the summoning circle there and defeat the succubus it calls. If you took What Is Love?, hand him the Wooden Figurine too, place it at the same circle and defeat the incubus.
  turnin 1738                         -- Gakin the Darkbinder
  accept 1739
  complete 1739                       -- Subdue the succubus
  turnin 1739                         -- Summon Succubus
  turnin 65602 optional               -- What Is Love?, if you took it
  accept 65603 optional
  kill 185335 quest 65603.1 optional  -- Summoned Incubus, at the same circle
  turnin 65603 optional               -- Gakin binds the incubus to you

step Shaman training
  only Shaman
  zone Ironforge
  tip Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge and train with Eldrun Stormbreaker. Gryth Thurden in the Great Forge flies to Southshore too.
  train class

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Southshore

step Fly to Southshore
  zone Stormwind City
  fly "Southshore"                    -- Dungar Longdrink, Trade District; Gryth Thurden, Ironforge

step Southshore
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  sethome "Southshore"
  accept 500                          -- Marshal Redpath
  turnin 538                          -- Loremaster Dibbs
  accept 540

step Shadowy Assassin
  tip A Shadowy Assassin lurks unseen on the edge of Southshore; kill him and read the contract he carries.
  kill 2434                           -- Shadowy Assassin
  collect 3668 "Assassin's Contract"
  accept 522
  turnin 522                          -- Magistrate Henry Maleb
  accept 523
  turnin 525                          -- Magistrate Henry Maleb
  accept 537

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Refuge Pointe

step Refuge Pointe
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Follow the road east out of Hillsbrad over Thoradin's Wall to Refuge Pointe.
  getfp "Refuge Pointe"               -- Cedrik Prose
  accept 681                          -- Captain Nials
  turnin 690                          -- Skuerto
  accept 691                          -- Apprentice Kryten

step Northfold Manor
  tip The Syndicate hold the farm north-west of Refuge Pointe. A Hay Weevil crawls about the farm: catch one with Amaryllis Webb's Entomology Starter Kit, then tick it off.
  kill 2586 quest 681.1               -- Syndicate Highwayman
  kill 2589 quest 681.2               -- Syndicate Mercenary
  kill 217589                         -- Hay Weevil: catch it, for My Little Friends

step Refuge Pointe
  turnin 681                          -- Captain Nials

step Thandol Span
  zone Wetlands
  tip Follow the road south over the bridge to Dun Modr at the Wetlands end, where Rhag Garmason waits.
  accept 631                          -- Rhag Garmason, Dun Modr

step Ebenezer Rustlocke
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Walk back onto the span: Ebenezer lies under its Arathi end.
  turnin 631                          -- Ebenezer Rustlocke's Corpse

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Faldir's Cove

step Faldir's Cove
  tip West along the coast to the goblins' cove; Lolo keeps watch on the rocks above it.
  accept 663                          -- Lolo the Lookout
  turnin 663                          -- Shakes O'Breen
  accept 662                          -- First Mate Nilzlix
  accept 664                          -- Captain Steelgut
  accept 665                          -- Professor Phizzlethorpe

step Phizzlethorpe
  tip Escort the professor to the beach north of the cove and guard him while he works; naga attack in waves.
  complete 665

step Doctor Draxlegauge
  turnin 665
  accept 666

step The wrecks
  tip The two wrecks lie in the bay west of the cove. The charts and logs are inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around them. Daggerspine naga swim the whole bay.
  collect 4487 quest 662.1            -- Maiden's Folly Charts
  collect 4489 quest 662.2            -- Maiden's Folly Log
  collect 4488 quest 662.3            -- Spirit of Silverpine Charts
  collect 4490 quest 662.4            -- Spirit of Silverpine Log
  collect 4492 quest 666              -- Elven Gem
  kill 2595 quest 664.1               -- Daggerspine Raider
  kill 2596 quest 664.2               -- Daggerspine Sorceress

step Faldir's Cove
  turnin 662                          -- First Mate Nilzlix
  turnin 666                          -- Doctor Draxlegauge
  accept 668
  turnin 664                          -- Captain Steelgut
  turnin 668                          -- Shakes O'Breen
  accept 669                          -- For Fleet Master Seahorn in Booty Bay: keep it

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Go'Shek Farm

step Quae
  tip Ride back north-east past Refuge Pointe; Quae and Kinelory camp in the hills north of Go'Shek Farm.
  turnin 659
  accept 658

step Forsaken Courier
  tip The courier walks the road west of Go'Shek Farm with two guards; pull them off the road.
  collect 4482 quest 658              -- Sealed Folder

step Quae and Kinelory
  turnin 658                          -- Quae
  accept 657
  turnin 657                          -- Kinelory
  accept 660

step Kinelory's errand
  tip Stay with Kinelory while she sneaks into Go'Shek Farm and back; Horde orcs jump you on the way.
  complete 660

step Quae
  turnin 660
  accept 661                          -- For Phin Odelic in Southshore

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Myzrael story

step Shards of Myzrael
  tip Head north past Go'Shek Farm; the shards glitter on the hill by the Circle of East Binding.
  turnin 635 optional                 -- Only if Gluggle gave you the pendant in Stranglethorn
  accept 642

step Drywhisker Gorge
  tip The Drywhisker kobolds dig in the gorge east of Hammerfall (Horde); skirt the town to the north. They drop both the motes and Krazek's ore.
  collect 4435 quest 642              -- Mote of Myzrael
  collect 4278 quest 627              -- Lesser Bloodstone Ore

step Iridescent Shards
  tip The shards lie at the far end of Drywhisker Gorge.
  turnin 642
  accept 651

step Witherbark Village
  tip The Witherbark trolls live in the hills south of Go'Shek Farm; Witch Doctors stand in the village, Shadow Hunters guard the far end of the valley.
  collect 4503 quest 691.1            -- Witherbark Tusk
  collect 4522 quest 691.2            -- Witherbark Medicine Pouch
  collect 5040 quest 691.3            -- Shadow Hunter Knife

step Stones of Binding
  tip Each key lies at one of the Highlands' standing-stone circles: east of the shards, near Refuge Pointe and in the west. The Stone of Inner Binding stands west of Refuge Pointe.
  collect 4483 quest 651.1            -- Burning Key: Stone of West Binding
  collect 4484 quest 651.2            -- Cresting Key: Stone of East Binding
  collect 4485 quest 651.3            -- Thundering Key: Stone of Outer Binding
  turnin 651                          -- Stone of Inner Binding

step Refuge Pointe
  turnin 691                          -- Apprentice Kryten
  accept 693                          -- Skuerto
  vendor nearest

step Kor'gresh Coldrage
  tip Kor'gresh, an ogre mage, holds the cave at the southern end of the Witherbark valley.
  collect 4525 quest 693              -- Trelane's Wand of Invocation

step Skuerto
  turnin 693
  hearth "Southshore"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Alterac Mountains

step Alterac Mountains
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Follow the road north out of Southshore into the mountains. Mountain lions roam the slopes; the Syndicate in Strahnbrad wear the signet rings, and Baron Vardus walks the manor grounds on the north side of town.
  kill 2406 quest 564.1               -- Mountain Lion
  kill 2407 quest 564.2               -- Hulking Mountain Lion
  collect 3505 quest 512              -- Alterac Signet Ring
  collect 3626 quest 523              -- Head of Baron Vardus

step Crushridge ogres
  tip The Crushridge ogres hold the hills north of Strahnbrad. Farther north, a worn wooden chest holds the Ensorcelled Parchment; Nagaz of the Dark Council stands right by it.
  collect 2843 quest 500              -- Dirty Knucklebones
  collect 3706 "Ensorcelled Parchment"
  accept 551
  collect 3672 quest 537.2            -- Head of Nagaz

step Ruins of Alterac
  tip The tomes lie in the ruined keep west of Strahnbrad; Argus Shadow Mages hold the ruins.
  collect 3658 quest 540.1            -- Recovered Tome: Crushridge ogres
  collect 3659 quest 540.2            -- Worn Leather Book: the Weathered Bookcase
  kill 2318 quest 537.1               -- Argus Shadow Mage

step Dalaran
  tip South-west to the Kirin Tor camp on the lake shore west of Dalaran, just over the border into Silverpine Forest: the Image of Archmage Modera stands there. Archmage Ansirem stands south-east of it, by the dome.
  zone Silverpine Forest
  turnin 92432 "An Alarming Request"  -- Image of Archmage Modera
  zone Alterac Mountains
  turnin 602                          -- Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver
  accept 603                          -- For Catelyn the Blade in Booty Bay: keep it

